      "pointer": "/source/original_text",
      "value": "Attributed ASTIS-authored scoped mathematical restatement/completion.\nLet E be a finite-dimensional real Hilbert Borel space with canonical volume, including rank zero as an explicit extension of the source Euclidean setting. Let V:E→ℝ be C2, 0<α≤β, and α‖v‖²≤D²V(x)[v,v]≤β‖v‖² for all x,v. Let η>0 and βη≤1. Set μ=volume.tilted(−V), J=Law(X,X+√ηZ) for independent X∼μ,Z∼N(0,I), ν=J.snd. Let P be the actual conditional-expectation orthogonal projection onto the second-coordinate sigma algebra in L²(J). There exists one linear isometry U:L²(J)→L²(J) whose AE representative is composition with F(x,y)=(x,2x−y), with U²=I and U self-adjoint. Define A=PUP and B=(I−P)UP. For every f∈ran P with ∫f dJ=0, ‖Af‖≤[(1−αη)/(1+αη)]‖f‖ and [4αη/(1+αη)²]‖f‖²≤‖Bf‖². This includes αη=1, uses the actual, potentially infinite-dimensional L²(J), without imposing finite-dimensionality on L², and is Test-level integration of already produced operators; Γ, its inverse and trajectories are not asserted.\nExact source boundary: PBPS2609.06905v1 AppendixB B1-B5 exact macro identification/centering feeding C3-C4 and B15. Public actual canonical pullback range=P range and centered image equality; real new Test transports exact57 scalar contraction to all actual centered macro f and squared defect gap.\nRemaining: PBPS2609.06905v1 AppendixB B1-B5 exact macro identification/centering feeding C3-C4 and B15. Public actual canonical pullback range=P range and centered image equality; real new Test transports exact57 scalar contraction to all actual centered macro f and squared defect gap. Finite real Hilbert/Borel/rank0 explicit extension; trueL2 generally infinite dimensional. Public generic pullback range and actual PBPS range/mean/centered image; realTest-only allmacro contraction/squaredBgap. NoGamma/fullweakH1/B13/B14/dynamics/main/cost/composition/fullpaper/Goal claim."
